<div id="comparison-index" class="min-h-screen bg-[#f4f1e9] text-slate-950">
  <header id="comparison-index-hero" class="border-b border-stone-300 bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
      <p class="border-l-2 border-teal-700 pl-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-teal-800">
        Compare tools and approaches
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-4xl font-serif text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] tracking-tight sm:text-7xl">
        Choose the right shape for your thinking.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
        RationalGrid is built for questions that branch into answers, challenges, evidence, sources, and new lines of inquiry. See how that approach differs from familiar research, debate, and mapping tools.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-12 sm:px-8 sm:py-16">
    <section id="comparison-index-pages" aria-labelledby="comparison-index-pages-heading">
      <div class="grid gap-5 border-b border-slate-400 pb-5 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_22rem] sm:items-end">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-teal-800">
            Current comparisons
          </p>
          <h2
            id="comparison-index-pages-heading"
            class="mt-2 font-serif text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl"
          >
            Start with the tool or method you know.
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
          Each guide explains where the alternative is stronger as well as where RationalGrid may fit better.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <a
          id="comparison-index-chatgpt"
          href="/compare/chatgpt"
          class="group flex h-full flex-col border border-stone-300 border-t-4 border-t-sky-600 bg-white p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-slate-500 hover:shadow-lg"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <.icon name="hero-chat-bubble-left-right" class="h-7 w-7 text-sky-700" />
            <.icon
              name="hero-arrow-up-right"
              class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-400 transition group-hover:text-teal-700"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="mt-7 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-sky-800">
            AI research
          </p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold">
            ChatGPT alternative for structured research
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 flex-1 leading-7 text-slate-600">
            Compare a flowing AI conversation with a durable map of questions, challenges, evidence, sources, and notes.
          </p>
          <span class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-teal-800">Read the comparison</span>
        </a>

        <a
          id="comparison-index-notebooklm"
          href="/compare/notebooklm"
          class="group flex h-full flex-col border border-stone-300 border-t-4 border-t-blue-600 bg-white p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-slate-500 hover:shadow-lg"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <.icon name="hero-book-open" class="h-7 w-7 text-blue-700" />
            <.icon
              name="hero-arrow-up-right"
              class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-400 transition group-hover:text-teal-700"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="mt-7 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-800">
            Source-grounded research
          </p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold">
            NotebookLM alternative for argument mapping
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 flex-1 leading-7 text-slate-600">
            Compare a source-grounded document workspace with a branching map of questions, challenges, evidence, and competing views.
          </p>
          <span class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-teal-800">Read the comparison</span>
        </a>

        <a
          id="comparison-index-elicit"
          href="/compare/elicit"
          class="group flex h-full flex-col border border-stone-300 border-t-4 border-t-emerald-600 bg-white p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-slate-500 hover:shadow-lg"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <.icon name="hero-document-magnifying-glass" class="h-7 w-7 text-emerald-700" />
            <.icon
              name="hero-arrow-up-right"
              class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-400 transition group-hover:text-teal-700"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="mt-7 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-emerald-800">
            Academic research
          </p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold">
            Elicit alternative for argument mapping
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 flex-1 leading-7 text-slate-600">
            Compare scientific-literature search and extraction with a connected map of the inquiry that follows.
          </p>
          <span class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-teal-800">Read the comparison</span>
        </a>

        <a
          id="comparison-index-kialo"
          href="/compare/kialo"
          class="group flex h-full flex-col border border-stone-300 border-t-4 border-t-violet-600 bg-white p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-slate-500 hover:shadow-lg"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <.icon name="hero-scale" class="h-7 w-7 text-violet-700" />
            <.icon
              name="hero-arrow-up-right"
              class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-400 transition group-hover:text-teal-700"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="mt-7 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-violet-800">
            Argument mapping
          </p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold">A free Kialo alternative</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 flex-1 leading-7 text-slate-600">
            Compare structured pro-and-con debate with a broader AI-assisted inquiry map.
          </p>
          <span class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-teal-800">Read the comparison</span>
        </a>

        <a
          id="comparison-index-mind-maps"
          href="/compare/mind-maps"
          class="group flex h-full flex-col border border-stone-300 border-t-4 border-t-amber-600 bg-white p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-slate-500 hover:shadow-lg"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <.icon name="hero-share" class="h-7 w-7 text-amber-700" />
            <.icon
              name="hero-arrow-up-right"
              class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-400 transition group-hover:text-teal-700"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="mt-7 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-amber-800">
            Visual thinking
          </p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold">Argument map vs mind map</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 flex-1 leading-7 text-slate-600">
            Compare free-form visual brainstorming with typed branches that explain why ideas are connected.
          </p>
          <span class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-teal-800">Read the comparison</span>
        </a>

        <a
          id="comparison-index-notion-obsidian"
          href="/compare/notion-obsidian"
          class="group flex h-full flex-col border border-stone-300 border-t-4 border-t-rose-600 bg-white p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-slate-500 hover:shadow-lg"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <.icon name="hero-arrow-path-rounded-square" class="h-7 w-7 text-rose-700" />
            <.icon
              name="hero-arrow-up-right"
              class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-400 transition group-hover:text-teal-700"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="mt-7 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-rose-800">
            Research workflow
          </p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold">
            RationalGrid with Notion and Obsidian
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 flex-1 leading-7 text-slate-600">
            Explore and structure a question first, then export it as Markdown and continue in your note-taking system.
          </p>
          <span class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-teal-800">Read the workflow</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="comparison-index-cta" class="mt-14 bg-teal-950 p-7 text-white sm:p-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold">Not sure which comparison fits?</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-teal-100">
        Start with one question and see whether a connected grid helps you follow the paths that matter.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          id="comparison-index-start-link"
          href="/?focus=grid#start-here"
          data-analytics-event="comparison_start_grid_clicked"
          data-analytics-comparison="index"
          data-analytics-placement="final_cta"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-teal-300 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-teal-200"
        >
          Start a free grid <.icon name="hero-arrow-right" class="h-4 w-4" />
        </a>
        <a
          id="comparison-index-guide-link"
          href="/intro/how"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-teal-300 px-1 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:text-teal-200"
        >
          See how RationalGrid works
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>
